    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Seaside Rally: Wave Sprint!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRace through stunning coastal tracks in this exhilarating arcade-style rally game. Take the wheel of adorable Q-style rally cars and conquer challenging courses set along scenic ocean roads. Perfect for players of all ages, Seaside Rally offers easy-to-learn controls and fast-paced gameplay that will keep you on the edge of your seat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCharming Visuals: Explore beautifully designed seaside environments filled with vibrant colors and detailed landscapes.<br />\r\nExciting Gameplay: Master tight turns, perform daring jumps, and race against AI opponents in thrilling races.<br />\r\nCustomizable Cars: Unlock and customize a variety of Q-style rally cars, each with unique attributes and appearances.<br />\r\nMultiple Game Modes: Challenge yourself in Career mode, compete against friends in local multiplayer, or set new records in Time Trial mode.<br />\r\nFamily-Friendly Fun: Suitable for players of all skill levels, from beginners to experienced racers.<br />\r\nJump into Seaside Rally: Wave Sprint and experience the thrill of high-speed racing on the coast like never before!",
